{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban school uniforms",
        "additional_details": "They also can be expensive, and a lot of students break the rules and don\u2019t wear the uniform properly. People say it\u2019s good to be unique but then they don\u2019t let kids express themselves.",
        "background": "I think school uniforms are uncomfortable. They\u2019re way too hot in the summer, and not warm enough in the winter, so I think students should be able to wear their own clothes. Some people might have sensory issues. I also think they limit people expressing themselves",
